{\b ADDENDUM to ITEM 2 \emdash Save display name on first Apple Sign-Up}\par
\par
Apple only returns the user's full name on the VERY FIRST sign-in. On all subsequent\par
sign-ins, fullName fields are nil. Firebase will not retry asking Apple for it.\par
So the name must be saved to the Firebase user profile immediately.\par
\par
In the signInWithApple() method in AuthManager.swift, after the successful\par
Auth.auth().signIn(with: firebaseCredential) call, add:\par
