Struct: MainAppContent

STEP 1 — Add state properties to MainAppContent (after the existing @State private var showingAIHelp = false line):

    @AppStorage("aiHelpBubbleX") private var savedBubbleX: Double = 0
    @AppStorage("aiHelpBubbleY") private var savedBubbleY: Double = 0
