STEP 2 — Replace the entire "// Floating AI Help button" block (the VStack with Spacer/HStack/Spacer/Button that starts after the TabView .tint line) with the following GeometryReader-based draggable version. The replacement must be inside the same ZStack as the TabView, as a sibling to it.

Replace this block:
    // Floating AI Help button
    VStack {
        Spacer()
        HStack {
            Spacer()
            Button {
                showingAIHelp = true
            } label: {
                Image(systemName: "bubble.left.and.sparkles.fill")
                    .font(.system(size: 22, weight: .semibold))
                    .foregroundColor(.white)
                    .frame(width: 52, height: 52)
                    .background(Color.stoqlyPrimary)
                    .clipShape(Circle())
                    .shadow(color: .black.opacity(0.25), radius: 8, x: 0, y: 4)
            }
            .accessibilityLabel("Ask AI")
            .padding(.trailing, 20)
            .padding(.bottom, 80)
        }
