PART B \emdash  VOICE HYBRID: Apple + Sarvam (Phase 3)\par
=====================\par
Design: prefer Apple on-device/free; fall back to Sarvam cloud ONLY for languages Apple cannot transcribe on that device. Sarvam supports INDIAN languages only (hi, ta, te, kn, ml, plus bn/gu/mr/od/pa) \emdash  it is the fallback for Telugu/Kannada/Malayalam (and Tamil on older iOS). Non-Indian languages rely on Apple.\par
\par
ITEM S14-B1 \emdash  SpeechTranscriber abstraction\par
Create AITest/Services/SpeechTranscription/:\par
- protocol SpeechTranscriber \{ func transcribe(...) async throws -> String ; static func supports(locale:) -> Bool \}\par
- AppleSpeechTranscriber: wraps SFSpeechRecognizer (existing VoiceInventoryView logic moves here).\par
- SarvamSpeechTranscriber: records audio to a file (m4a/wav), POSTs to Sarvam, returns transcript.\par
\par
ITEM S14-B2 \emdash  Runtime engine selection\par
- func pickEngine(for appLanguage) -> SpeechTranscriber:\par
    - map app language -> voice locale (hi->hi-IN, ta->ta-IN, te->te-IN, kn->kn-IN, ml->ml-IN, ar->ar-SA, es->es-ES, pt-BR->pt-BR, fr->fr-FR, zh-Hans->zh-CN, id->id-ID, de->de-DE, ru->ru-RU, ja->ja-JP, en->en-IN)\par
    - if SFSpeechRecognizer.supportedLocales() contains that locale -> AppleSpeechTranscriber\par
    - else if language is Indian (te/kn/ml/ta/hi) -> SarvamSpeechTranscriber\par
    - else -> nil (no engine): show the fallback UX in B4\par
- Use the CURRENT app language from LocalizationManager (S13), defaulting to device locale.\par
\par
ITEM S14-B3 \emdash  Sarvam integration\par
- Endpoint: POST https://api.sarvam.ai/speech-to-text\par
- Header: api-subscription-key: <SARVAM_API_KEY from SecretsManager>\par
- Multipart form: file=<recorded audio>, model="saaras:v3", language_code=<e.g. "kn-IN">, (optional) mode="codemix" to handle mixed English+regional speech.\par
- Response JSON: use the "transcript" field.\par
- Show a small "Recognizing (cloud)..." indicator while the request runs; handle network errors with a retry + graceful message.\par
\par
ITEM S14-B4 \emdash  VoiceInventoryView wiring + fallback UX\par
- Locale pills now reflect the selected app language (keep en-IN/en-US/en-GB for English; for other languages show that language's pill).\par
- Route recording through pickEngine(); if engine is Apple, live transcript as today; if Sarvam, record -> upload -> show transcript for edit.\par
