- Ensure FirestoreManager has deleteSale(id)/deleteMovement(id) (add if missing, mirror existing delete/sync patterns).\par
- Analytics: add StoqlyEvent.saleReversed / movementReversed (or reuse) and fire on success.\par
- New strings (Delete/Reverse, confirm messages, "Locked\u2026" note) -> catalog; run translate_catalog.py after build; then rebuild (per brief localization rule).\par
