WHY: Analytics today has many "started/opened/shown/viewed" events but almost no matching "cancelled/closed/dismissed" events, and Pro-locked controls open a paywall WITHOUT logging which control triggered it. Result: when a user does add_item_started then paywall_shown then leaves, we cannot tell what they tapped or whether they abandoned the add. This spec makes every meaningful user action emit an event: open AND close, tap Add AND tap Cancel AND swipe-dismiss.\par
