ROOT CAUSE: AITest/Services/AIInventoryService.swift builds the voice/photo/sheet prompts with NO current-date anchor, and the example shows a hardcoded date. With no "today", the model guesses an absolute date for relative phrases ("in 5 days", "next week") and lands on a stale/past date.\par
