CHANGES S44-3 behavior. S44 already enforces the 50-item/storage free cap at write (fetchCount-based), and for AI/bulk it currently auto-inserts new items up to 50 and SILENTLY SKIPS the leftovers + shows the item_limit paywall. Replace that silent auto-skip with a user-controlled selection at the review screen, so nothing disappears without the user's choice.\par
\par
Scope: the REVIEW screens of Voice / Photo / Paper counts AND the Bulk CSV/XLSX import preview. Non-Pro only (Pro = unlimited, no banner, everything selected/saved).\par
\par
Definitions:\par
- authoritativeCount = SubscriptionManager fetchCount of InventoryItem for the target storage (already added in S44-1).\par
- remainingSlots = max(0, freeItemLimit - authoritativeCount).\par
- Classify each parsed review row as UPDATE (matches an existing item by name/sku/barcode) or NEW (creates an item).\par
\par
Behavior:\par
1. UPDATES always apply and do NOT count against the cap; not deselectable (optionally grouped under "Will update").\par
2. NEW rows get an individual selection toggle. When newCount > remainingSlots, default the first \{remainingSlots\} selected, the rest DEselected.\par
3. Banner shown only when newCount > remainingSlots:\par
   "Free plan: 50 items per storage. You can add \{remainingSlots\} more here. Deselect items, or upgrade to Pro to add them all."  + [Upgrade to Pro] -> PaywallView(source:"item_limit", trigger:"item_cap_bulk").\par
4. Live counter near Save: "\{selectedNew\}/\{remainingSlots\} new items selected".\par
5. Disable Save while selectedNew > remainingSlots. If remainingSlots == 0: all NEW rows unselectable (greyed), banner "You're at the 50-item limit for this storage. Upgrade to Pro to add new items." UPDATES still save.\par
6. On Save: apply ALL updates + ONLY the selected NEW items (guaranteed <= cap). Keep item_added per new item; optionally track deselected/skipped count.\par
\par
Localization: add the banner + counter strings to Localizable.xcstrings and run the translator (0 gaps).\par
\par
VERIFY:\par
- Free user, storage has 46 items, voice-counts 20 new -> banner "add 4 more"; 4 preselected; Save disabled until selectedNew<=4; save adds 4 new + all updates; toggling selection works; Upgrade opens paywall.\par
- Storage at 50 -> NEW rows unselectable; UPDATES still save.\par
- Bulk CSV import into a near-full storage -> same selection UX in its preview.\par
- Pro -> no banner, all selected, unlimited.\par
